{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "72f8f793-2c3f-81f1-b9a4-04511a0eb605",
  "created_at": "2025-12-16T14:04:00-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Walter Hazard",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:00:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good afternoon, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:00:52-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good afternoon. I'm calling because there's a bunch of feral cats, a whole colony I think, hanging around the dumpsters near where I live, and I don't know who to call about it. Is this the right place? Is it okay to call you about that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:01:09-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a fine place to start, hon. Animal control matters come through us, and if I can't answer it myself I'll point you to the right person. How many cats are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:01:21-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I counted at least seven yesterday. Maybe more, they kind of dart in and out from behind the dumpsters. And that's what worries me, there are kids around there. Kids from the building, they cut through that way, and I keep thinking somebody's going to get scratched or bitten. You know, a kid goes to pet one, and that's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:01:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I understand. Are the cats acting aggressive at all, or are they mostly keeping to themselves?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:01:49-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly they run off. But one of them hissed at me, a gray one, when I took my trash out. And I just keep worrying about the children. Is that something the city can do anything about? Is it okay that I'm calling about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:02:05-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, I'm talking fast. I do payroll for a small firm and I have to get checks done by three, so I keep looking at the clock. I don't mean to rush you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:02:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're fine, we'll be quick. Let me take down your information and I'll send this over to the animal control officer. Can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:02:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Walter Hazard. H-A-Z-A-R-D."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:02:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Walter. And a number where they can reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:02:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0157. That's my cell. I'll pick up if I can, but if I'm in the middle of the payroll it might go to voicemail, so they can leave a message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:02:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Now, where exactly are the dumpsters? Is it a business or an apartment complex?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:02:52-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, it's the apartment lot. Behind the building, by the back lot. I'd rather not give the exact address on the phone, if that's okay. Can the officer just call me and I'll tell them where to meet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:03:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll note that you'll give the location when they call. I'll mark it as a feral colony near dumpsters with children in the area, so they know it matters."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:03:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Thank you. And you think somebody will actually come out? Because I really don't want a kid getting hurt. That's all I keep thinking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:03:27-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't tell you the exact day, but it goes to them today, and they'll call you. In the meantime, the best thing is to tell the kids not to touch any of the cats and not to leave food out near the dumpsters."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:03:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right, no food. I'll mention that. Okay, so it's logged, it's in, they'll call me. That's okay, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:03:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, Walter. It's in. Go get those checks done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:03:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you so much. I appreciate it. Bye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:03:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You take care. Bye-bye."
    }
  ],
